{"id":"41afb9581b2f8dfb","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-conservative-k4.md","title":"GL Conservative over K4","display":"df-gl-conservative-k4 — GL Conservative over K4","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-conservative-k4","aliases":["89-df-gl-conservative-k4"],"display":"df-gl-conservative-k4 — GL Conservative over K4","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-logic-k4]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-conservative-k4"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-conservative-k4</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-conservative-k4 — GL Conservative over K4"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9f30bc0c9c793d3\" href=\"?note=d9f30bc0c9c793d3\" title=\"89-df-modal-logic-k4\">89-df-modal-logic-k4</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{K4},\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{K4},\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> is a specified formula fragment.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conservative}_{\\mathcal F}(\\mathrm{GL},\\mathrm{K4})\">\\(\\mathrm{Conservative}_{\\mathcal F}(\\mathrm{GL},\\mathrm{K4})\\)</span> 是下述定义的二元保守性谓词，公式片段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F\\)</span> 为固定参数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}conservative\\text{-}k4}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Conservative}_{\\mathcal{F}}(\\mathrm{GL},\\mathrm{K4})\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathrm{GL}\\cap\\mathcal{F}\n=\n\\mathrm{K4}\\cap\\mathcal{F}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}conservative\\text{-}k4}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Conservative}_{\\mathcal{F}}(\\mathrm{GL},\\mathrm{K4})\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathrm{GL}\\cap\\mathcal{F}\n=\n\\mathrm{K4}\\cap\\mathcal{F}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The fragment <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F\\)</span> must be specified before a conservativity theorem is stated.</li>\n<li>本原子只定义相对于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F\\)</span> 的保守性谓词；它不宣称任意片段上\nGL 都相对于 K4 保守。具体片段上的成立性需要另行证明。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-logic-k4","status":"resolved","id":"d9f30bc0c9c793d3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-logic-k4]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{K4},\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{F}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Conservative}_{\\mathcal F}(\\mathrm{GL},\\mathrm{K4})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}conservative\\text{-}k4}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Conservative}_{\\mathcal{F}}(\\mathrm{GL},\\mathrm{K4})\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathrm{GL}\\cap\\mathcal{F}\n=\n\\mathrm{K4}\\cap\\mathcal{F}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F","display":false}],"bytes":1134,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-283","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-conservative-k4]]"}],"outgoing":["d9f30bc0c9c793d3","0006800fa1c85177"]}